title: Papers
---
<<declare $papers_state = 0>>

<<if $papers_state == 0>>
    You picked up the papers to do work…
    …And came to your senses and put them down.
    <<set $papers_state = 1>>
<<elseif $papers_state == 1>>
    You pick them up again, with a drive that could light the heavens…
    …And dropped them back on the table.
    <<set $papers_state = 2>>
<<else>>
    <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Paper Scatter">>
    The papers scattered in a mess. 
    You don't feel like picking them up again.
<<endif>>
===
